      'risk factors dehydration hot climate obesity diabetes recurrent utis hyperparathyroidism and family history a stone passing down the ureter causes severe waves of loin to groin pain renal colic blood in the urine and vomiting prevention drink 2 5 to 3 litres of fluid a day reduce salt keep normal calcium limit oxalate and animal protein',
